{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/0dc170ff1f247c9e85c7ea88119ad682.avif?t=1758220352\" data-has-big width=1560 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hell over Me</i> is a fast-paced roguelike first-person shooter where you descend into constantly shifting dimensions of a fractured sci-fi hell. Every run throws you into a new procedurally generated map with dynamic challenges and evolving mechanics. Explore level, face modular enemies and craft your own playstyle through an ever-growing arsenal of weapons, skills, and power-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/1ca92aac6fdfdee1faf4757642f2012b.poster.avif?t=1758220352\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/1ca92aac6fdfdee1faf4757642f2012b.webm?t=1758220352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/1ca92aac6fdfdee1faf4757642f2012b.mp4?t=1758220352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/9b39d483bb18d2dccd71f1bf538c56c7.avif?t=1758220352\" data-has-big width=1560 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural generation is at the core of <i>Hell over Me</i>. Every element \u2014 maps, enemies, weapons, encounters \u2014 is built from scratch for each run to ensure high replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/e725c23d59e4003314e7c3c9982e901a.webp?t=1758220352\" data-has-big width=1560 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Weapons are procedurally built from parts that shape behavior</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/1e77b0297605c2f67d70a804da90b0d6.poster.avif?t=1758220352\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/1e77b0297605c2f67d70a804da90b0d6.webm?t=1758220352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/1e77b0297605c2f67d70a804da90b0d6.mp4?t=1758220352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire type, spread, projectile physics, reload time \u2014 everything changes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rarity scales potential</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect insane combinations: sawblade SMGs, bouncing plasma rifles, extra explosive mortars and more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/1107d4871a5d0c04a78db42f34043f76.webp?t=1758220352\" data-has-big width=1560 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Modular upgrades transform how enemies look and fight</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base archetypes are enhanced by modules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jetpacks, shields, oversized cannons? Enemies can have them all</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modules\u00a0add or alter abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/30f4bc297183693c81255fe9c0388bf9.webp?t=1758220352\" data-has-big width=1560 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore shifting dimensions where no two runs feel the same</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/3cb238052e5fb41bc485b73b13f2674c.avif?t=1758220352\" data-has-big width=1560 height=530 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entire islands are procedurally built from scratch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges and side activities are randomized</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arenas adapt dynamically to enemy types</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/383fdad46c4f1fac8c19b93f77ebdbf0.avif?t=1758220352\" data-has-big width=1560 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your combat style with\u00a0unique skills, upgrades, and powerful synergies. Each run lets you experiment and evolve your approach to the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/278fd2a8d3af5b03d90743275b2e6321.webp?t=1758220352\" data-has-big width=1560 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Choose and combine active abilities to match your playstyle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/2b59b8382a932e7c33fcd27c6067ae02.poster.avif?t=1758220352\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/2b59b8382a932e7c33fcd27c6067ae02.webm?t=1758220352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/2b59b8382a932e7c33fcd27c6067ae02.mp4?t=1758220352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose two active skills at the start of each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and enhance them mid-run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All skills synergize with weapons and modifiers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/ad51c925053ac66188a2705b7bf92c9c.webp?t=1758220352\" data-has-big width=1560 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Expand your character\u2019s abilities with powerful upgrades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/2c4778059265d64d8bb9c9fcb3922e91.poster.avif?t=1758220352\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/2c4778059265d64d8bb9c9fcb3922e91.webm?t=1758220352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/2c4778059265d64d8bb9c9fcb3922e91.mp4?t=1758220352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes both passive bonuses and unique effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stacking the same modifiers increases its effectiveness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine different types to create deadly synergies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/f60856af757a53d86163c9088537cf30.avif?t=1758220352\" data-has-big width=1560 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The longer you survive, the more hostile the world becomes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/f0c5baea541fa25aea761c35c0b850d8.poster.avif?t=1758220352\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/f0c5baea541fa25aea761c35c0b850d8.webm?t=1758220352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/f0c5baea541fa25aea761c35c0b850d8.mp4?t=1758220352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environments shift dynamically over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies grow more aggressive, with new gameplay mechanics activating as the pressure builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual and audio cues reflect rising tension and danger</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4030880?t=1758220352","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/eb3fd253bb81fa5a8068c8c07ef