es potential</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect insane combinations: sawblade SMGs, bouncing plasma rifles, extra explosive mortars and more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/1107d4871a5d0c04a78db42f34043f76.webp?t=1758220352\" data-has-big width=1560 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Modular upgrades transform how enemies look and fight</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base archetypes are enhanced by modules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jetpacks, shields, oversized cannons? Enemies can have them all</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modules\u00a0add or alter abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/30f4bc297183693c81255fe9c0388bf9.webp?t=1758220352\" data-has-big width=1560 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore shifting dimensions where no two runs feel the same</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/3cb238052e5fb41bc485b73b13f2674c.avif?t=1758220352\" data-has-big width=1560 height=530 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entire islands are procedurally built from scratch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges and side activities are randomized</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arenas adapt dynamically to enemy types</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.s