43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Expand your character\u2019s abilities with powerful upgrades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/2c4778059265d64d8bb9c9fcb3922e91.poster.avif?t=1758220352\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/2c4778059265d64d8bb9c9fcb3922e91.webm?t=1758220352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/2c4778059265d64d8bb9c9fcb3922e91.mp4?t=1758220352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes both passive bonuses and unique effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stacking the same modifiers increases its effectiveness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine different types to create deadly synergies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/f60856af757a53d86163c9088537cf30.avif?t=1758220352\" data-has-big width=1560 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The longer you survive, the more hostile the world becomes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/f0c5baea541fa25aea761c35c0b850d8.poster.avif?t=1758220352\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/f0c5baea541fa25aea761c35c0b850d8.webm?t=1758220352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/extras/f0c5baea541fa25aea761c35c0b850d8.mp4?t=1758220352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environments shift dynamically over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies grow more aggressive, with new gameplay mechanics activating as the pressure builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual and audio cues reflect rising tension and danger</p></li></ul>","developers":["Selfish Snakes"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030880/ded34cf9644edc5519f911be1eb79ffc655e0353/header.jpg?t=1758220352","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All the rights belong to Selfish Snakes.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04 LTS / SteamOS 3.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5\u20148400F / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660 / AMD Radeon RX 580</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12 Monterey<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 / Intel(R) Core(TM) i5\u20148400F<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1 GPU / AMD Radeon Pro 5500M<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2400 MB available space</li></ul>"},"name":"Hell over Me","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5\u20148400F / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</